        "created_at": "2017-11-29T18:44:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nilus,Shoot an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a>. That will go into our new customer service queue, which will mean that we can cancel that order and get it taken care of. We'll also get you the PDF if you still can't dload them - that is showing as fixed on our end…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hi Paul I’m having the same issue I sent an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a> and also my order today shows it shipped but I haven’t had any email notification from fedex&nbsp;</p>",
