      {
        "id": 209491,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-01T15:44:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you're still having this problem, please do e-mail contact@greaterthangames.com. If you have e-mailed and are not getting a response, please follow-up and copy me on the e-mail. It's important to me that we get the PDFs to all of you, and that we provide good communication throughout this process.</p><p>Also, if you get the physical Starter Kit from your FLGS, they can get you the PDFs through the Bits and Mortar system!</p>",
