      {
        "id": 209492,
        "name": "Dorado585",
        "username": "Dorado585",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/898d66/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-01T17:15:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not only am I having problems with the PDFs, I can't get any responses to ANY of my emails to the contact@greaterthangames.com address. It's useless to suggest people to email there. I placed an order more than a week ago with two-day shipping, still can't access the PDFs, can't find out any information about my order, and can't seem to get any support information.</p><p>I do know, however, that I've been charged for a game I can't access and that I'm not even sure is shipping to me, although I paid extra to expedite it (allegedly, it's Order #46). I've done numerous Kickstarters, ordered from dozens of game companies directly, and have never had the issues I've had ordering as I have from this site/company. I don't even mind snags, but I've had days worth of emails go unanswered, and that's unconscionable.</p><p>Really have been looking forward to this game - I demo'd it at GenCon.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:39:37.016Z",
